            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Nhật Bản Hatsumoude",
            "review_text": "Dream57915097544\n2 contributions\n0\nThe atmosphere and taste of Japan can be tasted in Hanoi.\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nWhen I travel abroad, I always want to eat Japanese food after trying local food. I was walking in this area with a lot of Japanese shops and I entered this store because I was curious. Vietnamese people who are good at Japanese greeted us. It felt like I was going to forget I was in Hanoi. Potato salad, yakitori, hockey, eichle, ramen and okonomiyaki were all satisfying. If you come to Hanoi, this is the place to stop again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten March 1, 2025",
